        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 16.61.5703</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 384)</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.558">Section 16.61.558</a> REPEALED (Use of Passenger Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 16.61.5704</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 385)</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.559">Section 16.61.559</a> REPEALED (Taxicab and Buses to Park Only in Designated Stands – Rights of Other Vehicles in Such Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C31398.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, June 5, 1995</p><p>Effective Date: Wednesday, July 5, 1995</p><p>Cross Reference: Renumbered to 16.61.5705</p><p>(Ord C31398  Section 386)</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.560">Section 16.61.560</a> REPEALED (Stopping, Standing, or Parking Outside Business or Residence Districts)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.561">Section 16.61.561</a> REPEALED (parking Time Limited and Regulated)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.562">Section 16.61.562</a> REPEALED (Parking Non-passenger Vehicles in Residence Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.563">Section 16.61.563</a> REPEALED (Parking in Alley Regulated)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.564">Section 16.61.564</a> REPEALED (Parking Restricted for Snow Removal or Other Street Needs)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.565">Section 16.61.565</a> REPEALED (Parking in Such Manner as to Obstruct Traffic)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.566">Section 16.61.566</a> REPEALED (Standing at Angle to Curb and Backing to Curb Regulated)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.567">Section 16.61.567</a> REPEALED (Prohibited Parking Practices)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.570">Section 16.61.570</a> REPEALED (Stopping, Standing, or Parking Prohibited in Specified Places – Reserving Portion of Highway Prohibited)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.5701">Section 16.61.5701</a> REPEALED (Establishment of Special Parking Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.5702">Section 16.61.5702</a> REPEALED (Taxicab Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.5704">Section 16.61.5704</a> REPEALED (Use of Passenger Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, November 10, 2008</p><p>Effective Date: Thursday, January 1, 2009</p><p>ORD C34333 Section 1</p>							<a href="/smc/?Section=16.61.5705">Section 16.61.5705</a> REPEALED (Taxicabs and Buses to Park Only in Designated Stands – Rights of Other Vehicles in Such Zones)<br />
        <p>Repealed by ORD C34333.</p>
